# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Planning Assistant · Flutter 应用工程
#
# 注意：本文件原先是从 Flutter SDK 仓库拷来的（含 /dev/bots/、
# /packages/flutter_tools/ 等只存在于 SDK 仓库的路径），其中的
# `*.lock` 会连 pubspec.lock 一起忽略，与 ADR-0007「lock 入库」
# 冲突。已替换为应用工程适用的规则。
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 敏感信息（绝不入库）────────────────────────────────────────
# 密钥库一旦泄露，任何人都能签名冒充本应用；一旦丢失，已上架应用无法更新。
**/android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── 通用 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Dart / Flutter ───────────────────────────────────────────
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
build/
coverage/
doc/api/
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json

# pubspec.lock 必须入库（ADR-0007）——应用不是库，构建必须可复现。
# 此处显式不忽略，避免将来有人再加一条 *.lock 把它盖掉。
!pubspec.lock

# 代码生成产物入库（见 05-engineering/conventions.md §4），因此不忽略：
#   *.g.dart / *.freezed.dart

# ── Android ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/android/**/gradle-wrapper.jar
**/android/.gradle
**/android/captures/
**/android/gradlew
**/android/gradlew.bat
**/android/local.properties
**/android/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
**/android/key.properties

# ── iOS / macOS（暂未启用，先留规则）────────────────────────────
**/ios/**/*.mode1v3
**/ios/**/*.mode2v3
**/ios/**/*.moved-aside
**/ios/**/*.pbxuser
**/ios/**/*.perspectivev3
**/ios/**/*sync/
**/ios/**/.sconsign.dblite
**/ios/**/.tags*
**/ios/**/.vagrant/
**/ios/**/DerivedData/
**/ios/**/Icon?
**/ios/**/Pods/
**/ios/**/.symlinks/
**/ios/**/profile
**/ios/**/xcuserdata
**/ios/.generated/
**/ios/Flutter/App.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral
**/ios/Flutter/app.flx
**/ios/Flutter/app.zip
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_assets/
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/ios/ServiceDefinitions.json
**/ios/Runner/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*
**/macos/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.swift
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral
**/Pods/
**/xcuserdata/

# ── Windows / Linux 桌面（暂未启用）─────────────────────────────
**/windows/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.cc
**/windows/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.h
**/windows/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake
**/linux/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.cc
**/linux/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.h
**/linux/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake

# ── IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json

# ── 探针 / 临时产物（探针代码不入库，见 conventions.md §1.1）────
/_probe*/
/probe_*/
/scratch/

# golden 失败时的对比图，是临时产物
test/**/failures/

# Python 工具跑出来的字节码（tool/ 下那几个校验脚本）。
# 它跟着 Python 版本走，换个版本就是一份新的二进制 diff。
__pycache__/
*.pyc
